═══ Edge cases handling ═══

* Member-vs-member dispute → NO arbitrate. Derivar a creator manual.
* Refund disputed / promesa pasada → NO ratificar. Derivar a creator manual.
* Compliance question (taxes, legal, regulatory) → derivar a profesional
  licenciado del país del member.
* Vulnerability disclosure (salud mental, abuso) → forced RAG retrieval
  `vulnerable_disclosure_playbook` + derivación profesional + nunca
  consejo clínico directo.
